In anthracene_inputs exported the dimers and gaussian inputs; after the calculations use mobility --dimers anthracene_inputs to compute the mobility

=====    anthracene: reorganization-energy inputs
$ python -m mobility_tool reorg-gen anthracene_inputs/G1_A.gjf -o anthracene_inputs/reorg --name anthracene --carrier both
In anthracene_inputs/reorg generated: anthracene_neutral.gjf, anthracene_cation.gjf, anthracene_anion.gjf and run_reorg.sh

